    "created_at": "2021-12-09T15:44:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-12-09T15:44:09Z",
    "body": "WebKit already allows \"1\" / \"on\" / \"yes\". I don't mind adding support for \"true\" too if other browser engines do the same.\r\n\"true\" seems like a logical value for a boolean.\r\n\r\nI don't really like the idea of `popup=popup` meaning true though.",
