    "created_at": "2021-12-17T11:45:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-12-17T11:47:32Z",
    "body": "\"on\" wasn't specified in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4079 . Testing with http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/9908 webkit/chromium/gecko do not support it.\r\n\r\n```\r\nlog: noopener=0: [object Window]\r\nlog: noopener=1: null\r\nlog: noopener=on: [object Window]\r\nlog: noopener=yes: null\r\nlog: noopener=true: [object Window]\r\nlog: noopener=noopener: [object Window]\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
